## ImageViewer @VERSION@

**언어 / Language**: 한국어 아래에 영어가 이어집니다. / English follows Korean.

### 처음 실행하기 / First launch

macOS 빌드는 ad-hoc 서명만 적용되어 Apple 공증이 없으므로 처음 한 번은 Gatekeeper 확인 절차가 필요합니다.
[최초 실행 안내](https://github.com/Ezenitac-AiService/ImageViewer/blob/main/docs/FIRST_LAUNCH.md)를 따라 주세요.
This macOS build is ad-hoc signed without Apple notarization, so Gatekeeper asks once before the first launch.
Follow the [first-launch guide](https://github.com/Ezenitac-AiService/ImageViewer/blob/main/docs/FIRST_LAUNCH.en.md).

### 검증된 플랫폼 / Verified platforms

| Platform | Arch | Tier | Automated | Clean device | Status |
|----------|------|------|-----------|--------------|--------|
| macOS | Apple Silicon (`arm64`) | Top priority | @MAC_ARM_AUTO@ | @MAC_ARM@ | @MAC_ARM_STATUS@ |
| macOS | Intel (`x86_64`) | Top priority | @MAC_X64_AUTO@ | @MAC_X64@ | @MAC_X64_STATUS@ |
| iOS | `arm64` | Top priority (planned — feature `007`) | n/a | n/a | planned (not in this release) |
| Linux | `x86_64` | Lower priority (build-only) | n/a (no runtime verification) | n/a | build-only, unverified |
| Android | `arm64` | Lower priority (planned — feature `007`) | n/a (no runtime verification) | n/a | planned build-only (not in this release) |

"Automated" comes from the `launch-verification-macos-*.json` records attached to this release.
"Clean device" is filled in by the maintainer before publishing.

### 알려진 제한 / Known limitations

- Apple 공증이 없어 최초 실행 시 macOS Gatekeeper 확인이 필요합니다.
  Not Apple-notarized: a one-time macOS Gatekeeper confirmation is needed on first launch.
- Linux 아카이브는 하위 우선순위 **빌드 전용·런타임 미검증** 산출물이며 실행 검증을 수행하지 않습니다.
  The Linux tarball is a **lower-priority build-only, runtime-unverified** artifact and undergoes no launch or runtime verification.
- Windows는 Constitution v3.0.0에 따라 지원 대상에서 제외되었습니다(레거시 Windows 기록은 `legacy-v1.0.6` 태그 참고).
  Windows is excluded under Constitution v3.0.0 (see the `legacy-v1.0.6` tag for legacy history).
- 이 버전에서 제공하지 않는 기능은 [기능 목록](https://github.com/Ezenitac-AiService/ImageViewer/blob/main/docs/CAPABILITIES.md)을 참고하세요.
  Capabilities that are not available in this version are listed in the [capability register](https://github.com/Ezenitac-AiService/ImageViewer/blob/main/docs/CAPABILITIES.en.md).
- v1.0.6 대비 성능 동등성: 측정되지 않음.
  Performance parity with v1.0.6: unmeasured.

### 무결성 / Integrity

```text
sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS.txt --ignore-missing
```
